<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair becomes SAirGroup.</title>
<headline>Swissair becomes SAirGroup.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Swissair AG have approved changing the group's name to SAirGroup and turning it into a holding company structure.</p>
<p>The plan to change the name of the Swiss airline group was already announced in December and since then the group has used the name of SAirGroup in public.</p>
<p>The name change and new structure was broadly accepted by the shareholders, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>SAirGroup said 2,816 shareholders attended the meeting, representing 65.1 percent of voting rights.</p>
<p>Shares in the group will now be listed as SAirGroup instead of Swissair.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
